OL,3,GNEWSAMother begs council to keep
OL,4,Aleisure centre pool open
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother says her severely disabled son
OL,7,Fcould lose the only place where he is
OL,8,Fable to go swimming if a leisure centre
OL,9,Fin Leicester closes.
OL,11,FLeicester City Council is consulting on
OL,12,Fproposals that could see New Parks
OL,13,FLeisure Centre close as part of plans
OL,14,Fto reshape leisure services across the
OL,15,Fcity.
OL,17,FSusan Wilder said the centre was the
OL,18,Fonly pool she has found that was able
OL,19,Fto accommodate her 19-year-old son, who
OL,20,Fis a full-time wheelchair user with
OL,21,Fcomplex physical, visual and hearing
OL,22,Fimpairments.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
