OL,3,GNEWSAMother begs council to keep
OL,4,Aleisure centre pool open
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe city council said it was "always
OL,7,Fhappy" to speak to customers about
OL,8,Ftheir individual needs and how pool
OL,9,Fhoists could be adapted for them.
